          "title": "Flaky tests were always an annoying problem. With agentic coding, it's 100x worse. You run many more builds and tests passing are the feedback loop your agent needs.\n\nWith CloudBees Smart Tests, we can identify your flaky tests and allow you to quarantine them so they stop breaking your builds. Once you isolated them, you can focus on fixing those tests and if we observe that they stopped being flaky, we will automatically include them in your builds again.\n\nRead Jake's blog post to learn more. Fantastic new feature Naoto Samyak Yoshiori  👏 \n\nhttps://lnkd.in/gzhdAyhQ",
